# PROVENANCE — infinity6b0

SigmaStar Infinity6B0, the SSC333 line. Kernel 4.9.84, same as Infinity6E --
confirmed from the built tree (`include/config/kernel.release`) for
johnchia/linux @ 289323e3301024554bb49652cd92960df459fe14, not assumed from the
